### Tests des routes d'authentification
### Inscription
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "username": "Test User"
}

### Connexion
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Déconnexion
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Obtenir le profil utilisateur
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Tests des routes du frigo
### Obtenir tous les ingrédients du frigo
GET {{baseUrl}}/fridge
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Ajouter un ingrédient au frigo
POST {{baseUrl}}/fridge
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ingredientName": "Lait",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unit": "L",
  "expiryDate": "2024-04-01"
}

### Mettre à jour un ingrédient
PUT {{baseUrl}}/fridge/cm91i9g4m0001qc0uo62iabwv
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ingredientName": "Lait",
  "quantity": 2,
  "unit": "L",
  "expiryDate": "2024-04-15"
}

### Supprimer un ingrédient
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/fridge/cm91i9g4m0001qc0uo62iabwv
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Obtenir les ingrédients qui vont périmer
GET {{baseUrl}}/fridge/expiring?days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Tests des routes des appareils
### Obtenir tous les appareils
GET {{baseUrl}}/appliances
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Obtenir un appareil par ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/appliances/cm91ibt380002qc0uwmnl48bk
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Ajouter un appareil
POST {{baseUrl}}/appliances
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gasinière",
  "description": "Gasinière de 1000W"
}

### Mettre à jour un appareil
PUT {{baseUrl}}/appliances/cm91ibt380002qc0uwmnl48bk
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Four électrique",
  "description": "Four électrique de 1000W"
}

### Supprimer un appareil
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/appliances/cm91ibt380002qc0uwmnl48bk
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Tests des routes des recettes
### Créer une nouvelle recette
POST {{baseUrl}}/recipes
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Gratin dauphinois",
  "ingredients": [
    {
      "name": "Pommes de terre",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unit": "kg"
    },
    {
      "name": "Crème fraîche",
      "quantity": 200,
      "unit": "ml"
    }
  ],
  "cookingTime": 60,
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "appliances": ["four"],
  "instructions": ["1. Éplucher les pommes de terre...", "2. Préchauffer le four à 180°C"]
}

### Trouver des recettes similaires
POST {{baseUrl}}/recipes/similar
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fridgeItems": ["pommes de terre", "crème fraîche"],
  "appliances": ["four"],
  "maxCookingTime": 90
}

### Obtenir une recette par ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes/cm91jcmev0001lz0uyonigldk
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Mettre à jour une recette
PUT {{baseUrl}}/recipes/cm91jcmev0001lz0uyonigldk
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Gratin dauphinois amélioré",
  "cookingTime": 75
}

### Supprimer une recette
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/recipes/cm91jcmev0001lz0uyonigldk
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Tests des routes des listes de courses
### Obtenir toutes les listes de courses
GET {{baseUrl}}/shopping-lists
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Créer une nouvelle liste de courses
POST {{baseUrl}}/shopping-lists
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Courses hebdomadaires",
  "items": [
    {
      "ingredientName": "Pain",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unit": "baguette"
    }
  ]
}

### Mettre à jour une liste de courses
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shopping-lists/cm91jzzjy0000pl0u0d1bbeb8
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Courses mensuelles",
  "status": "pending"
}

### Supprimer une liste de courses
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shopping-lists/cm91jzzjy0000pl0u0d1bbeb8
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Ajouter un item à une liste
POST {{baseUrl}}/shopping-lists/cm91jzzjy0000pl0u0d1bbeb8/items
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ingredientName": "Lait",
  "quantity": 2,
  "unit": "L"
}

### Mettre à jour un item d'une liste
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shopping-lists/cm91jzzjy0000pl0u0d1bbeb8/items/cm91k5hed0000sa0u9hat9bam
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ingredientName": "Lait",
  "quantity": 3,
  "unit": "L"
}

### Supprimer un item d'une liste
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shopping-lists/cm91jzzjy0000pl0u0d1bbeb8/items/cm91k5hed0000sa0u9hat9bam
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Valider une liste de courses
POST {{baseUrl}}/shopping-lists/cm91jzzjy0000pl0u0d1bbeb8/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Tests des routes d'IA
### Générer des suggestions de recettes
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/suggest-recipes
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ingredients": ["pommes de terre", "crème fraîche"],
  "appliances": ["four"]
}

### Analyser une recette
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/analyze-recipe
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipe": "Gratin dauphinois traditionnel avec pommes de terre, crème fraîche et fromage râpé"
}

### Générer une liste de courses
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/generate-shopping-list
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipe": "Gratin dauphinois traditionnel avec pommes de terre, crème fraîche et fromage râpé"
}
